e model output shows very high confidence, but that still does **not** make this a confirmed diagnosis.\n- **Summary:** The pipeline judged the image as likely related to kidney cancer, but says definitive diagnosis requires further evaluation.\n- **Visual evidence:** The image appears to show a kidney tumor consistent with the model’s prediction.\n- **Recommended next steps:**\n  1. Further imaging such as CT or MRI to confirm presence and extent.\n  2. Biopsy or surgical excision for histopathology.\n  3. Review with a urologist or oncologist to discuss management.\n\n**References**\n- *Kidney Cancer: Diagnosis and Treatment* — American Cancer Society (2022)  \n  https://www.cancer.org/cancer/kidney-cancer/detection-diagnosis-staging.html\n- *Kidney Tumors: A Review of the Literature* — Journal of Urology (2020)  \n  https://www.jurology.com/article/S0022-5347(20)30273-5/\n\n**Important:** this pipeline output is a **preliminary signal, not an actual diagnosis**.\n\nAnalyzer image:\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/9218e225-5d74-498e-ad9e-ba64cc6d84bc.jpg\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n- a **short plain-English interpretation**, or\n- the **raw structured response**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ed6dc373c5281050169cd0a6c3eb88191b7032bf20ba5e20b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9261,"output":547,"cacheRead":12032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21840,"cost":{"input":0.023152500000000003,"output":0.008205,"cacheRead":0.003008,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0343655}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775045226146}}
